that Elizabeth Warren has had a trajectory

00:00:48.579 --> 00:00:52.030
that has sort of been immune from the ups
and downs of other candidates.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:54.820
Lots of candidates have had big ups and downs.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.210
Elizabeth Warren hasn't had that as you see
on your screen.

00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:03.639
Elizabeth Warren has had a slow steady climb
about 1.5 points per month dating back to

00:01:03.639 --> 00:01:11.469
April and she is now within the margin of
error, but in second place averaging 16.3%

00:01:11.469 --> 00:01:12.469
