00:01:26.289 --> 00:01:28.460
So important data points.

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:32.600
First of all, Bernie, Warren and Harris are
still really close.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:34.810
There's only two points in total.

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:37.350
Uh, separating the three of them.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:38.350
Important to keep that in mind.

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:40.369
These are small changes that we're seeing.

00:01:40.369 --> 00:01:46.070
Another note, the distance between the top
